OL,3,GNEWSAReform backs acting council leader
OL,4,Afor long-term job
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform UK councillors have nominated
OL,7,Facting Leicestershire County Council
OL,8,Fleader Kevin Crook as their candidate
OL,9,Fto take on the role in the long term.
OL,11,FCrook took on the role temporarily when
OL,12,Fformer council leader Dan Harrison
OL,13,Fresigned after comments he made about
OL,14,Fstaff redundancies that were leaked
OL,15,Fonline.
OL,17,FA new long-term leader will be elected
OL,18,Fin a vote at a full council meeting on
OL,19,F2 December.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
