OL,3,GNEWSAReform backs acting council leader
OL,4,Afor long-term job
OL,5,
OL,6,FCrook was elected as the new leader of
OL,7,Fthe council's ruling Reform group on
OL,8,FTuesday, and will be the party's
OL,9,Fcandidate in the full council
OL,10,Fleadership vote.
